{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会in名古屋‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって初全握だったのですが\n楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強風で寒い中来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ったらからだ熱くなるから\nライブでは寒さは気にならなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はいくちゃん、ちはる、ひめかが\n学業で欠席でしたx(\nゆきなは高熱で欠席><\n第5レーンは\nれいか、ななせ、私の3人になってしまったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて握手した方\n名古屋個握に来てくださった方\nわざわざ名古屋に来てくださった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手冷たくて心配をおかけしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷え性って、どうしたら治るの⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で反省しなきゃいけないところとか沢山あって。\n落ち着いて握手できなかった><\n自分の気持ちばっかりばんばん言ってしまったり\nそんなにしゃべれなかったり\nと、いろいろあったので\nみなさんがもっと楽しめるように\n頑張りたいですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わったあとみんなで味噌カツ食べた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味噌カツおいしすぎる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはカツには味噌の時代だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすか、まりか、ひなちま、みなみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わおっっJC‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にんじんのお漬物があったのですが\n3人はおいしさをわかってくれなかったぜ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人の分も食した笑\nにんじんのお漬物おいしいっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊\nそして私ついに自己紹介で\nあだ名募集宣言をしたのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんとまりかが一番多かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あれ⁇←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントでも沢山考えてくださって\nありがとうございました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんそれぞれオリジナルの\nあだ名で呼んでくださる方も\n沢山いるので基本はまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...がいいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからも普段まりかって呼ばれてるからに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷ったらまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って呼んでください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂一のベビーフェイス\n伊藤万理華です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近とまともあだ名悩んでるんだって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜きれい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/08/6698797/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はOFFなのでしっかり休みます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}